## Model card

- **Name:** Inkling 2 Small
- **Short description:** Local metadata describes Inkling 2 Small as the production MoE model (594B total / 17B active, 1M context, image input) revealed as the identity behind the Fledge Alpha stealth preview.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode/Zen preview lineage per metadata (`opencode/inkling-2-small`, `noFreeId`). Fledge Alpha preview was free; production pricing not published in reviewed sources.
- **Release / knowledge:** Revealed identity context per local metadata/changelog references. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed sources.
- **IDs:** `inkling-2-small`, `Inkling 2 Small`, aliases include `Fledge Alpha`, `fledge-alpha*` (per local metadata).
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens total; 131,072 max output (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Fledge Alpha preview billed at $0 during preview per metadata; production pricing not published.
- **Architecture:** MoE (594B total / 17B active) per local metadata; architecture details not publicly documented in reviewed sources.

